Attribution here does not imply that every concept, module, implementation, or claim in this repository originated from either contributor. Specific contributions should be attributed according to the work actually represented in the relevant code, documentation, or research.

This repository therefore preserves two principles:

«Give credit for ideas and contributions.»

«Claim only what can currently be demonstrated.»

The broader SWI architecture may extend beyond the implementation contained in this repository as future layers are reconstructed, implemented, tested, and verified.
